---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Navbar from "../components/Navbar.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<Layout title="Shipping & Returns" description="yaopulife shipping and returns for custom made-to-order phone cases — worldwide shipping, production times, and a clear made-to-order returns policy.">
  <Navbar />

  <section class="py-20 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900">Shipping &amp; Returns</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-gray-500">Last updated: June 26, 2026</p>

      <div class="mt-12 prose prose-lg text-gray-600">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">Shipping Information</h2>
        <p>We ship worldwide from our studio in Dongguan, China. Estimated transit times after shipment:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>United States:</strong> 7-14 business days</li>
          <li><strong>Europe:</strong> 10-16 business days</li>
          <li><strong>Other regions:</strong> 14-21 business days</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Shipping cost and final timing are confirmed in your written quote before payment. Orders include a tracking number by email once shipped.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mt-8">Production Time</h2>
        <p>Each case is made to order after you approve your proof. Production is typically <strong>7-12 business days</strong>, separate from shipping time above.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mt-8">Returns Policy</h2>
        <p>
          Made-to-order cases are eligible for replacement or refund for <strong>defects, production errors, or items
          materially different from the proof you approved</strong>, verified by photos of the item you received.
        </p>
        <p>
          Customer-entry mistakes (wrong text, low-resolution photo), change of mind, and normal variation already
          disclosed on the product page are not covered. Because each case is personalized and made to order, please
          review your proof carefully before approving production.
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">
          The exact claim window, the photo evidence we ask for, and who pays return shipping are stated in the written
          quote or invoice you approve before payment. This site has no automated checkout.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mt-8">Contact Us</h2>
        <p>Questions about shipping or returns? Email us at <a href="mailto:hello@yaopulife.com" class="text-brand-600">hello@yaopulife.com</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
